5. Sequence to sink: if `x.bv_len >= 15`, check passes; then `x.bv_val += tu->bv_len + 1; x.bv_len -= tu->bv_len + 1;` (lines ~130-131). When `tu->bv_len == x.bv_len`, subtraction underflows (unsigned `ber_len_t`) and `x.bv_val` advances past the allocated `in->bv_val` end.
